lements, particularly (e) risk management and (l) corrective and preventive actions.  The missed detection also implicates ISO 13485 clauses related to traceability and reporting of complaints, as referenced in qmsr-820.10-b-regulatory-crossrefs. The software lifecycle requirements outlined in mdr-annexI-sec17.2-software-lifecycle emphasize risk management and verification/validation for devices incorporating software; this incident highlights a potential gap in those processes.", "recommendation": "CAPA_INVESTIGATE", "requires_human_review": true, "severity": 3}, "final_report_sha256": "0e468c9364054188f8693ffbb20430d365a5302fa80d1f181db9269f60f1f6f2", "generation_source": "ollama_real", "invalid_proposals": 0, "is_fallback": false, "is_mock": false, "opa_actions": ["technical_incident_missing_technical_evidence", "deny:technical_incident_missing_technical_evidence"], "recommendation": "CAPA_INVESTIGATE", "record_type": "terminal", "report_id": "SYN-IND-0028", "retrievals": 1, "revisions": 0, "run_id": "SYN-IND-0028_r1", "scenario_id": "SYN-IND-0028", "schema_version": "2.1.0", "severity": 3, "shacl_findings": [], "state_terminal": "terminal", "termination_reason": "human escalation or invalid transition", "timestamp_utc": "2026-08-04T22:23:06.188566Z", "total_steps": 5, "trace_id": "54ca101f-5e63-4b1b-b2bc-fca45302e72a"}
